    "Registry of every course unpacked into courses/. Maintained by `stc unpack`,",
    "read by `stc test|shell|status|publish`. Hand-editing is fine.",
    "",
    "  slug       directory name under courses/, and the platform's course slug",
    "  language   language slug from .shipthatcode.json; selects the container image",
    "  entrypoint the single file the executor compiles",
    "  lessons    lesson count, from .shipthatcode.json",
    "  mirror     public repo the grader pulls; set it before `stc publish`",
    "  linked     whether the mirror URL has been pasted on the course page yet",
    "  status     not-started | in-progress | complete",
    "  at         lesson number currently being worked on",
    "",
    "wishlist entries additionally carry:",
    "  languages  the language options the course actually offers, once known",
    "             (build courses let you choose; the set varies per course and",
    "              isn't visible without logging in). null = not checked yet.",
    "  pick       the language chosen for it -- see docs/roadmap.md for why"
  ],
